OL,3,GNEWSAResidents give new street signs
OL,4,Amixed reviews
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to install over 100 new street
OL,7,Fsigns in a town have received mixed
OL,8,Freviews from residents, with some
OL,9,Flabelling the replacements as "cheap".
OL,11,FDacorum Borough Council said it was
OL,12,Fputting them up in the Maylands area of
OL,13,FHemel Hempstead, Hertfordshire, as part
OL,14,Fof a project to improve navigation.
OL,16,F"They just look really cheap. I don't
OL,17,Fsee the point of changing them over
OL,18,Freally, the old ones look much better,"
OL,19,Fsaid resident Paula Bridges.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
