OL,3,GNEWSAResidents give new street signs
OL,4,Amixed reviews
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said its Maylands
OL,7,FWayfinding Project, which includes the
OL,8,F122 new street signs, was in response
OL,9,Fto feedback from local businesses about
OL,10,Finconsistent signage, confusing routes,
OL,11,Fand a lack of clear identity.
